/div><div class="text-block-9">RXRX<span class="text-span-8">3</span></div></div><nav class="w-dropdown-list"><a href="#about" class="nav-link secondary-nav dropdown w-dropdown-link">Introduction</a><a href="#The-Biology" class="nav-link secondary-nav dropdown w-dropdown-link">Dataset Comparisons</a><a href="#license" class="nav-link secondary-nav dropdown w-dropdown-link">License</a></nav></div></div><div class="div-block-25"><a href="#Download" class="button-4 w-button">Download</a></div></div><div data-collapse="none" data-animation="default" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navbar secondary-nav rxrx1 w-nav"><div class="container-2 w-container"><div class="div-block-21"><div><div class="text-block-9">RxRx<strong>3</strong></div></div><nav role="navigation" class="nav-menu w-nav-menu"><a href="#about" class="nav-link w-nav-link">Introduction</a><a href="#The-Biology" class="nav-link w-nav-link">Dataset Comparisons</a><a href="#license" class="nav-link w-nav-link">License</a><a href="#Download" class="button-4 w-button">Download</a></nav></div><div class="w-nav-button"><div class="icon w-icon-nav-menu"></div></div></div></div><div class="section-3"><div class="brand-canvas"><div class="div-block-16"><div class="text-block-2">NeurIPS 2019 competition<br/>coming soon:<br/></div><div class="text-block-3 white"><span class="text-span">CellSignal</span>: Disentangling biological signal from experimental noise in cellular images.</div><div class="div-block-17"><a href="#" class="w-inline-block w-lightbox"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5cb63fe47eb5472014c3dae6/5d152026eaa3edcfa7078c47_play-btn.png" width="46.5" alt=""/><script type="application/json" class="w-json">{
